{
    "title": "Solitaire 3D Fish",
    "description": "Have you tried Solitaire 3D Fish yet? This is a brand new creative solitaire card game with unique 3D graphics and interface, providing you with the most vivid scenes and 3D effects of fish.\r\n\r\nNot only can you experience challenging and fun card games, but there are also dozens of different styles of fish tanks (including holiday-themed ones obtained for a limited time) waiting for you to unlock. Collect dozens of different marine fish species (Clownfish, Blue Tang, Holacanthus Africanus, Bannerfish, Powder Blue Tang, Azure Damselfish, Anglerfish) through the \"Gashapon\" in the game. Come and turn your fish tank into a unique aquarium exhibition!\r\n\r\n<b>Highlights</b>\r\n\r\n- CREATIVE SOLITAIRE GAME\r\nBased on the classic solitaire (also known as Patience), we've added a CREATIVE aquarium world with the unique \"Star Chest\" feature.\r\n\r\n- BEAUTIFUL UNDERSEA THEMES\r\nWhile enjoying the classic solitaire games, you will be totally immersed yourself in an amazing unique aquarium world with delicate undersea surroundings and creatures.\r\n\r\n- THOUSANDS OF CHALLENGES\r\nTogether with Daily Challenges, there are over tens of thousands of classic solitaire challenges for you to play anytime and anywhere!\r\n\r\n- SURPRISING BOOSTERS & ANIMATIONS\r\nIf you get stuck, you can use the \"Magic Wand\" for help to continue the game. And there are different kinds of animations when you win certain deals.\r\n\r\n- PLAYER-SELECTABLE GAMEPLAY PACE\r\nAfter entering the game, you can use the \"Whirlwind\" preitem before starting the hand to accelerate your progress and help you pass through more challenging levels.\r\n\r\n<b>How to play</b>\r\n\r\n- Up to 10 top records\r\n- Solitaire card game, draw 1 card or 3 cards\r\n- Standard scoring\r\n- Single tap or drag&drop to move cards\r\n- Daily challenges with different levels\r\n- Auto-collect cards on completion\r\n- Undo function available\r\n- Hint function available\r\n- Timer mode available\r\n- Left-handed mode available\r\n- Offline game! No wifi required\r\n\r\nLove playing Patience solitaire card games? It's undoubtedly the Best classic solitaire card game with a <b>creative 3D</b> fish theme! Download and enjoy it <b>NOW</b>!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Have you tried Solitaire 3D Fish yet? This is a brand new creative solitaire card game with unique 3D graphics and interface, providing you with the most vivid scenes and 3D effects of fish.<br><br>Not only can you experience challenging and fun card games, but there are also dozens of different styles of fish tanks (including holiday-themed ones obtained for a limited time) waiting for you to unlock. Collect dozens of different marine fish species (Clownfish, Blue Tang, Holacanthus Africanus, Bannerfish, Powder Blue Tang, Azure Damselfish, Anglerfish) through the &quot;Gashapon&quot; in the game. Come and turn your fish tank into a unique aquarium exhibition!<br><br><b>Highlights</b><br><br>- CREATIVE SOLITAIRE GAME<br>Based on the classic solitaire (also known as Patience), we&#39;ve added a CREATIVE aquarium world with the unique &quot;Star Chest&quot; feature.<br><br>- BEAUTIFUL UNDERSEA THEMES<br>While enjoying the classic solitaire games, you will be totally immersed yourself in an amazing unique aquarium world with delicate undersea surroundings and creatures.<br><br>- THOUSANDS OF CHALLENGES<br>Together with Daily Challenges, there are over tens of thousands of classic solitaire challenges for you to play anytime and anywhere!<br><br>- SURPRISING BOOSTERS &amp; ANIMATIONS<br>If you get stuck, you can use the &quot;Magic Wand&quot; for help to continue the game. And there are different kinds of animations when you win certain deals.<br><br>- PLAYER-SELECTABLE GAMEPLAY PACE<br>After entering the game, you can use the &quot;Whirlwind&quot; preitem before starting the hand to accelerate your progress and help you pass through more challenging levels.<br><br><b>How to play</b><br><br>- Up to 10 top records<br>- Solitaire card game, draw 1 card or 3 cards<br>- Standard scoring<br>- Single tap or drag&amp;drop to move cards<br>- Daily challenges with different levels<br>- Auto-collect cards on completion<br>- Undo function available<br>- Hint function available<br>- Timer mode available<br>- Left-handed mode available<br>- Offline game! No wifi required<br><br>Love playing Patience solitaire card games? It&#39;s undoubtedly the Best classic solitaire card game with a <b>creative 3D</b> fish theme! Download and enjoy it <b>NOW</b>!",
